# The 8 tasks of dsv41-flash-overfit8-a3.yaml, one instance_id per line (the source of truth): the
# task directory names on miles-datasets:/tb4t-20261016/tasks. Four overfit8 tasks that
# overfit-1018-a1/a2 solved 59-80% of the time, plus four harder ones from the 1017 pass@3 eval
# (dsv41-1017-eval-a, 256k, 7,200 s agent), aiming at a ~0.5 pass rate. The eval understated
# training pass rates (its 1/3 tasks trained at 0.59-0.80), so two 0/3 tasks are in. All four new
# tasks peaked above 200k at least once, so they need 256k. Note: eval passes/3 with a trial that
# hit 256k scored 0, peak context of the 3 trials, a1+a2 pass rate.
# Spares, in order: software-009 (1/3, 186-259k), mp-checkpoint-consolidation-04-gptq-mixed-packing-
# to-fp16 (2/3, 163-258k, easier), media-parallel-013-20260919 (1/3, 152-219k).
# The prompt file keeps only these tasks' rows of the eval's prompt file (eval1017_A.jsonl):
#   grep -F -f <(grep -v '^#' dsv41-flash-overfit8-a3.tasks | awk '{print "\"instance_id\": \"" $1 "\""}') \
#     eval1017_A.jsonl > $MILES_DATA/prompts/overfit8_a3.jsonl
atrx-vep-crispr-05-go-obsolete-term-remediation          # 1/3, 78-99k, 0.62
science-017                                              # 1/3, 105-129k, 0.59
wal-recovery-ordering-11-persist-queue-ack-recovery      # 2/3, 162-177k, 0.59
bp105-security-email-auth-policy-r01                     # 1/3, 158-171k, 0.80
telecom-entity-resolution-r2-cms-hospital-ccn-crosswalk  # 1/3, 231-258k
bp240-media-typography-r03                               # 1/3, 205-259k
media-004                                                # 0/3, 108-230k
bp105-media-skeletal-animation-r01                       # 0/3, 214-219k
